# AiFamily — environment template
#
# Wave 0 (AIFAMILY-000) requires NO environment variables. This file exists to
# establish the convention and to record, up front, the two rules the legacy
# repository broke:
#
#   1. No real credential ever enters version control. The legacy repo had
#      `.demo-family.txt` / `.demo-guardian.txt` / `.demo-token.txt` sitting at
#      its root. Nothing of that shape is admitted here.
#   2. Model provider credentials are read by the Model Gateway only. No domain
#      module reads a provider key. See governance/REPOSITORY_CONSTITUTION.md R7.
#
# Variables below are declared by the wave that introduces them.

# --- Wave 1 (AIFAMILY-001) will introduce ---
# APP_ENV=local
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://aifamily:aifamily@localhost:5432/aifamily
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
